flowchart TD
    %% write_reflection with sources
    call[write_reflection section plus sources] --> each[Each named source]
    each --> readable{Caller may read it?}
    readable -- no --> hidden[Refuse: unavailable source]
    readable -- yes --> wide{Source domain narrower than the page domain?}
    wide -- no --> ok[Accept the source]
    wide -- yes --> ask{Client can ask the person?}
    ask -- no --> drop[Refuse: leave the text out]
    ask -- yes --> person{Person shares it on purpose?}
    person -- yes --> ok
    person -- no --> drop
    ok --> write[Write the section with provenance]
    write --> page[/reflections page/]
